40-aio-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1250/15466.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Recommends\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      BUG online\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Recommends</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      From series to series, water cooling Ryuo, the fruit of the collaboration between Asus and Asetek, is an increasingly better product. In addition to simple assembly and convincing performance, Ryuo III brings us an attractive AniMe Matrix screen, which many users will really like, because it is not only used to display animations, but also useful data related to computer operation, such as hardware temperatures.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CROATIA</span> <span>02/23/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG RYUO III 240 ARGB Media review Award of Recommends\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.bug.hr/preview/d82b9cc00c863f0677016242aad1a08a-31285\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1250/15466.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Recommends\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      BUG online\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Recommends</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Design\n     Material quality\n     Ease of assembly\n     Excellent performance\n     AniMe Matrix screen\n     Six-year warranty\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CROATIA</span> <span>02/23/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG RYUO III 240 ARGB Media review Award of Recommends\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.bug.hr/preview/9152605b2aab6952943feeb84e5ac03e-31286\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1250/202001151712268190280.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Recommends\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      PC Ekspert\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Recommends</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Design, quality of materials, ease of assembly, solid performance, AniMe Matrix screen, warranty.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CROATIA</span> <span>01/06/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG RYUO III 240 ARGB Media review Award of Recommends\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"http://www.pcekspert.com/clanak/asus-rog-ryuo-iii-240-black-white-recenzija/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1250/202303132130261630750.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Recommends\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      PC EKspert YouTube\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Recommends</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      After testing the Ryuo III 360 cooler, we have now tried the Ryuo III 240 models in white and black versions. The conclusion remains that from series to series this is an increasingly better product that is always at a very high level.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CROATIA</span> <span>01/06/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG RYUO III 240 ARGB Media review Award of Recommends\" t